# Carnelian Orb of Dragonkind's "If that mana is spent on a Dragon creature spell, it gains haste until end of turn" is an
# effect of the mana (CR 106.6), not a triggered ability: it has no "when", "whenever" or "at" (CR 603.1). Nothing goes on the
# stack beside the Firespitter Whelp, so Bot2's Stifle ("counter target activated or triggered ability") has nothing to
# target and is never offered, and the Whelp has haste and attacks the turn it was cast (20 to 18).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby x2
Black Lotus
Carnelian Orb of Dragonkind
Firespitter Whelp
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Stifle
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Carnelian Orb of Dragonkind.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Carnelian Orb of Dragonkind.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Firespitter Whelp.Cast
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
! Bot2.Hand.Stifle.Cast
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Firespitter Whelp.Keywords = Flying; Haste
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Firespitter Whelp > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
